### get all

GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses
### get by id
GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses/6

### get by name
GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses/search?name=java

### create

POST  http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Go for Hacking",
    "description": "Go programming language for hacking"

}


